<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50468" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱμείρω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῑ]</span>, 
			Aeol.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰμέρρω</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			Sapph.
			1.27
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Alc.
			<u>Supp.</u>
			26.5
		</span></i>, cf. Hdn.Gr. <i><span class="en">
			2.949
		</span></i>: (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵμερος</span>):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>long for, desire</i>, c. gen.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τί κακῶν ἱμείρετε τούτων . .
			</span>; <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				10.431
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				555
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Sc.</u>
				31
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεγάλων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					B.
					1.62
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάχης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					940
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βίου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					952
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				435
			</span></i>: c. inf., <i>long</i> or <i>wish</i> to do, <i><span class="en">
				Alc.
			</span></i> l.c., <i><span class="en">
				Sol.
				13.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				233
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				587
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ichn.</u>
				128
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄσσα μοι τέλεσσαι θῦμος ἰμέρρει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sapph.
				</span></i>
			 l.c.: c. Adj. neut., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γνωτὰ κοὐκ ἄγνωτά μοι προσήλθεθ᾽
					ἱμείροντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OT</u>
					59
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>El.</u>
				1053
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσμένοις . . καὶ ἱμείρουσιν . . τὸ
					φῶς ἐγίγνετο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Cra.</u>
					418d
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Med.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱμείρομαι</span></b> , aor. 1
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱμειράμην</span> ll.<i><span class="en">
				14.163
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, aor. 1
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱμέρθην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					7.44
				</span></i>
			: c. gen., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁππότ᾽ ἂν ἡβήσῃ τε
				καὶ ἧς ἱμείρεται αἴης</span> (
				Ep.
			
			aor.
			subj.) <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				1.41
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρημάτων ἱ. μεγάλως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					3.123
				</span></i>
			: c. inf., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴ πως
				ἱμείραιτο παραδραθέειν φιλότητι</span> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵμερος</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				14.163
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				1.59
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				6.120
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				386
			</span></i>.—
				Ep.
			, 
				Ion.
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
			</span></i> and <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Morb.</u>
				4.39
			</span></i>), and Trag. word: never in 
				Att.
			 Prose; introduced as etym. in <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Cra.</u>
			</span></i> l.c.</div>
